please clean your book’s dust.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you move like a snail,&lt;br&gt;
you&amp;rsquo;ll never end up on Yale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Teach your mind to rewind,&lt;br&gt;
never leave knowledge behind,&lt;br&gt;
what should be defined,&lt;br&gt;
is what you&amp;rsquo;ll get as assigned.&lt;/p&gt;
